    "our_story_section_dbM3WL": {
      "type": "our-story-section",
      "name": "Our Story Section",
      "settings": {
        "left_image": "shopify://shop_images/Background_-_Blue.png",
        "right_image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_2292.jpg",
        "heading": "Our Story",
        "text": "<p>Shoreline Brands began in 2022, right after our first daughter was born. We wanted to keep enjoying days on the boat with family and friends, but needed extra sun protection for our growing family. Traditional bimini tops were bulky, time-consuming, and offered limited shade.</p><p>That challenge inspired the creation of the Shoreline Shade, a lightweight, easy-to-use bimini top extension kit that mounts directly to your wakeboard tower, sets up in under 60 seconds, and provides shade coverage for the bow or stern.</p><p>As avid boaters ourselves, this innovation helped us maximize our time on the water and became the foundation for everything Shoreline Brands stands for: quality, practicality, and family-driven design.</p><p></p><h3><strong>OUR PRODUCTS</strong></h3><p>Our flagship Universal Wake Tower Bimini Extension remains at the heart of what we do. Today, Shoreline Brands offers over 18 variations of bimini extension kits to fit nearly every make and model of boat. Each shade is customizable to your exact setup, ensuring the perfect fit and effortless functionality.</p><p>Not sure which product is right for you? <a href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact\">Contact us</a>; our expert team is happy to guide you.</p>"
      }
    },
