        "left_heading": "Crafted in the USA",
        "left_text": "Every Shoreline Brands sunshade kit is proudly crafted in the USA. Each bimini extension is hand-sewn and assembled locally in Lancaster, Pennsylvania, ensuring unmatched quality, consistency, and attention to detail.",
