        "right_heading": "What Is a Bimini Extension?",
        "right_text": "A bimini extension is an aftermarket add-on that enhances your boat’s existing factory bimini top. Constructed from proprietary spandex material and supported by two carbon fiber poles and aluminum mounting brackets, the bimini top extension kit increases shaded coverage and sun protection for passengers on board.\n\nCommonly referred to as Bimini Extensions, Shade Sails, Transom Awnings, Wake Shades, or Stern Shades, these kits are designed to fit a wide range of boating styles.",
